<!doctype lake><title>🚋 𝓜𝓮𝓰𝓪𝓽𝓻𝓸𝓷</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="QEqw6" id="QEqw6" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="udc76a431" id="udc76a431">🍄</span><span data-lake-id="ue1391c19" id="ue1391c19"> 𝐌𝐞𝐠𝐚𝐭𝐫𝐨𝐧-𝐋𝐌: 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐌𝐮𝐥𝐭𝐢-𝐁𝐢𝐥𝐥𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐦𝐞𝐭𝐞𝐫 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬 𝐔𝐬𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐦</span></h1><p data-lake-id="uc630b51f" id="uc630b51f"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud9a8c1eb" id="ud9a8c1eb">随着模型规模不断增大，其内存需求逐渐超出现代处理器的容量限制，因此需要采用激活检查点等额外的内存管理技术</span></strong></p><ul list="ud58d1788"><li fid="udb52afa2" data-lake-id="u77dbfec4" id="u77dbfec4"><span data-lake-id="u2e680457" id="u2e680457">ADAM 等广泛使用的优化算法需要为每个参数分配额外内存，以存储动量及其他优化器状态，从而进一步限制能够有效训练的模型规模</span></li><li fid="udb52afa2" data-lake-id="u44f1ba70" id="u44f1ba70"><span data-lake-id="u8c133a00" id="u8c133a00">若干模型并行方法通过对模型进行划分来突破这一限制，使模型权重及其对应的优化器状态无需同时驻留于同一处理器的内存中</span></li><li fid="udb52afa2" data-lake-id="u026b9a83" id="u026b9a83"><span data-lake-id="u8f240931" id="u8f240931">GPipe 和 Mesh-TensorFlow 提供支持不同类型模型并行的框架。然而，这些方法需要重写模型，并依赖仍处于开发阶段的定制编译器和框架</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3fcbde28" id="u3fcbde28"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2d02f4ff" id="u2d02f4ff">在本研究中，采用层内模型并行，实现一种简单而高效的模型并行方法。利用基于 Transformer 的语言模型所固有的结构，构建一种简洁的模型并行实现，使其能够在 PyTorch 中高效训练，而无需编写定制的 C++ 代码或使用定制编译器。该方法与 GPipe 等工作所采用的流水线模型并行方法相互正交</span></strong></p><ul list="ueb97e1b8"><li fid="u8b1817d3" data-lake-id="u72cf057a" id="u72cf057a"><span data-lake-id="u08025a5e" id="u08025a5e">仅对现有的 PyTorch Transformer 实现进行少量有针对性的修改，便实现一种简单而高效的模型并行方法</span></li><li fid="u8b1817d3" data-lake-id="ua1504727" id="ua1504727"><span data-lake-id="u33826042" id="u33826042">对所提出的模型并行与数据并行技术进行深入的实证分析，并在使用 512 张 GPU 时实现最高 76% 的扩展效率</span></li><li fid="u8b1817d3" data-lake-id="u8617329b" id="u8617329b"><span data-lake-id="ue2c31871" id="ue2c31871">证明在类 BERT 模型中，合理设置层归一化的位置，对于在模型规模增大时持续提高准确率至关重要</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="znorp" id="znorp" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uaea49148" id="uaea49148">🪐</span><span data-lake-id="u4f7ac3f5" id="u4f7ac3f5"> 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐞𝐥 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐞𝐫𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u8f9d7996" id="u8f9d7996"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1f765309" id="u1f765309">MLP 模块的第一部分由一次通用矩阵乘法及其后的 GeLU 非线性激活函数组成</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u48c8057a" id="u48c8057a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BGeLU%7D(XA)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb1c5568a3a92e2de6fdcee9bc3621378.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XDnka%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ued7ee29a"><li fid="u8c32c539" data-lake-id="ude397ef7" id="ude397ef7"><span data-lake-id="u51784ce1" id="u51784ce1">对这一 GEMM 进行并行化的一种选择，是沿行维度划分权重矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde951302f41d4707b9d80ca1af34dd0f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YGan6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4a43ada4" id="u4a43ada4">，并沿列维度划分输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94e79ad0c1aabeafef9e2fc4af6adf66.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YebWe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua78fa093" id="ua78fa093">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u39b57bd4" id="u39b57bd4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%20%3D%20%5BX_1%2C%20X_2%5D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20A%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%20A_1%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20A_2%20%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F136f15a5422718a33681cfe195e19424.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d1cit%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud57fe826"><li fid="uf83cb87f" data-lake-id="udd0089f2" id="udd0089f2"><span data-lake-id="u075a5320" id="u075a5320">这种划分方式得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BGeLU%7D(X_1A_1%20%2B%20X_2A_2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5af84d2ef1be31f296b2a7dd4dca4c39.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kAxtu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04f611ec" id="u04f611ec">。由于 GeLU 是非线性函数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BGeLU%7D(X_1A_1%20%2B%20X_2A_2)%20%5C%5Cneq%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BGeLU%7D(X_1A_1)%20%2B%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BGeLU%7D(X_2A_2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4eff67e6b429f86a6ee87a4d914bec28.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Swl1r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud3c03da4" id="ud3c03da4">，因此，这种方法需要在执行 GeLU 函数之前设置一个同步点</span></li><li fid="uf83cb87f" data-lake-id="u66372193" id="u66372193"><span data-lake-id="u61f78247" id="u61f78247">另一种选择是沿列维度划分</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde951302f41d4707b9d80ca1af34dd0f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G9Dvv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u90dae4b9" id="u90dae4b9">，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22A%20%3D%20%5BA_1%2C%20A_2%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fddce8c59fb4c97ba97ea9c22daf7782c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZH4g6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udca938e7" id="udca938e7">。这种划分方式允许对各个划分后的 GEMM 输出独立应用 GeLU 非线性激活函数：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufc9163c6" id="ufc9163c6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5BY_1%2C%20Y_2%5D%20%3D%20%5B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BGeLU%7D(XA_1)%2C%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BGeLU%7D(XA_2)%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3471c5337c58fac1675f8ae7d101fc22.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bwtrf%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u8d37e585"><li fid="u2d719b25" data-lake-id="ub4a5ac24" id="ub4a5ac24"><strong><span data-lake-id="u11dc1bb1" id="u11dc1bb1" style="color: #DF2A3F">这种方式的优势在于能够消除一个同步点。因此，采用上述列并行方式划分第一个 GEMM，并沿行维度划分第二个 GEMM，使其能够直接接收 GeLU 层的输出，而无需进行任何通信。随后，在将第二个 GEMM 的输出传递至 Dropout 层之前，跨 GPU 对其执行归约</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue84ae321" id="ue84ae321">。该方法将 MLP 模块中的两个 GEMM 均划分至多个 GPU 上，且在前向传播中仅需要一次 all-reduce 操作，在反向传播中也仅需要一次 all-reduce 操作。这两个算子互为共轭，在 PyTorch 中仅需几行代码即可实现</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uaeafb4cb" id="uaeafb4cb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790934946532-9d192acc-5dc3-47e1-95ef-ce0249a5cdfa.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u105e4440-4611-4d2e-a70f-76c888d3c79%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uac272bee-8d23-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A506%2C%22height%22%3A226%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A180223%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A960%2C%22originHeight%22%3A429%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22stroke%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22Z%3DDROPOUT(YB)%22%2C%22x%22%3A619%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A198%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A%3D%5BA%2CA2%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A168%2C%22y%22%3A332%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3DGELU(XA%22%2C%22x%22%3A152%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A167%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A6%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A385%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A63%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%87%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A384%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A60%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A16%2C%22y%22%3A87%2C%22width%22%3A14%2C%22height%22%3A236%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A824%2C%22y%22%3A141%2C%22width%22%3A12%2C%22height%22%3A76%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XA2%22%2C%22x%22%3A271%2C%22y%22%3A243%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Y2B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A568%2C%22y%22%3A246%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YB1%22%2C%22x%22%3A563%2C%22y%22%3A111%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XA%22%2C%22x%22%3A270%2C%22y%22%3A110%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2222%22%2C%22x%22%3A673%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A113%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B%22%2C%22x%22%3A711%2C%22y%22%3A357%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A714%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e4d8c8%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uaa1531b3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufffb55cc" id="ufffb55cc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1333738c" id="u1333738c">对于自注意力模块，利用多头注意力运算所固有的并行性，以列并行方式划分与键、查询和值相关的 GEMM，使每个注意力头对应的矩阵乘法均在单张 GPU 上本地完成。由此，能够按照注意力头将参数和计算负载分配至不同 GPU，且完成自注意力计算无需立即进行通信</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u096235a8" id="u096235a8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790935107653-2da202b4-bb11-49d5-a9fe-238c7cef4549.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9aec873c-bff4-423c-9d06-29da56544ce%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uac272bee-8d23-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A494.20001220703125%2C%22height%22%3A234%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A246979%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1124%2C%22originHeight%22%3A532%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22stroke%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3DSELF-ATTENTION(X%22%2C%22x%22%3A252%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A211%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G%3DDROPOUT(YB)%22%2C%22x%22%3A781%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A194%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D%5BK%2CK%22%2C%22x%22%3A416%2C%22y%22%3A446%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B%3D2%22%2C%22x%22%3A814%2C%22y%22%3A389%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A48%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SPLITATTENTIONHEADS-%22%2C%22x%22%3A164%2C%22y%22%3A453%2C%22width%22%3A212%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3DV%2CL%22%2C%22x%22%3A428%2C%22y%22%3A476%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A449%2C%22y%22%3A142%2C%22width%22%3A9%2C%22height%22%3A74%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Q%3D%5BQ1Q2%22%2C%22x%22%3A417%2C%22y%22%3A423%2C%22width%22%3A123%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A519%2C%22y%22%3A273%2C%22width%22%3A14%2C%22height%22%3A58%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A521%2C%22y%22%3A136%2C%22width%22%3A11%2C%22height%22%3A76%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A9%AC%22%2C%22x%22%3A377%2C%22y%22%3A148%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A452%2C%22y%22%3A287%2C%22width%22%3A9%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YB%22%2C%22x%22%3A718%2C%22y%22%3A174%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A968%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A77%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Q2%22%2C%22x%22%3A284%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A482%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Q1%22%2C%22x%22%3A288%2C%22y%22%3A152%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22x%22%3A273%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Z%22%2C%22x%22%3A830%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AD%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A378%2C%22y%22%3A320%2C%22width%22%3A11%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%E4%B8%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A285%2C%22y%22%3A378%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K2%22%2C%22x%22%3A279%2C%22y%22%3A280%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f5f3%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22plmXr%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="uaaeb81cc"><li fid="u22bfb3c9" data-lake-id="u4f27a1d0" id="u4f27a1d0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2cb3453a" id="u2cb3453a" style="color: #5C0036">自注意力之后的输出线性层所对应的 GEMM 则沿行维度进行并行化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u35e78c90" id="u35e78c90">，直接接收并行注意力层的输出，而无需在 GPU 之间进行通信</span></li><li fid="u22bfb3c9" data-lake-id="u06cb5228" id="u06cb5228"><span data-lake-id="ud20ad949" id="ud20ad949">对于 MLP 层和自注意力层，这种方法均将两个 GEMM 作为一组进行融合，消除二者之间的同步点，从而实现更好的扩展性。因此，仅需在前向传播中执行两次 all-reduce，并在反向传播中执行两次 all-reduce，即可完成一个基本 Transformer 层中的全部 GEMM 运算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9eac8865" id="u9eac8865" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790935145845-b8acad9f-cded-4e1c-987f-3a7650f39368.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5deac1f4-88a1-42d8-9195-c33206709dd%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uac272bee-8d23-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A527%2C%22height%22%3A243%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A390066%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1426%2C%22originHeight%22%3A657%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22stroke%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22(FORWARD%2BBACKWARD)%22%2C%22x%22%3A784%2C%22y%22%3A600%2C%22width%22%3A396%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(FORWARD%2BBACKWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A214%2C%22y%22%3A594%2C%22width%22%3A391%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222ALL-REDUCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A844%2C%22y%22%3A548%2C%22width%22%3A270%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222ALL-REDUCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A268%2C%22y%22%3A541%2C%22width%22%3A272%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%A7%22%2C%22x%22%3A153%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A234%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A279%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A183%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A723%2C%22y%22%3A88%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A224%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PARALLEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A300%2C%22y%22%3A452%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A538%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A194%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PARALLEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A904%2C%22y%22%3A452%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A1180%2C%22y%22%3A103%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A195%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%87%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A1067%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A148%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A850%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A147%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A311%2C%22y%22%3A402%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A920%2C%22y%22%3A400%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228%22%2C%22x%22%3A958%2C%22y%22%3A113%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A144%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%87%B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A327%2C%22y%22%3A135%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A106%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A429%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A142%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1136%2C%22y%22%3A133%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A125%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%AD%22%2C%22x%22%3A372%2C%22y%22%3A153%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A81%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1301%2C%22y%22%3A182%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A495%2C%22y%22%3A142%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A113%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B9%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A596%2C%22y%22%3A168%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A60%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23efefed%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u23cd0917%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2fb53b79" id="u2fb53b79"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub9643ed9" id="ub9643ed9">Transformer 语言模型具有一个输出嵌入矩阵，其维度为隐藏层维度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fff1b78684db901dd0b7bfa173991deab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22igi0W%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8d383f11" id="u8d383f11">乘以词表大小</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa770a282bbfa0ae1ec474b7ed311656d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PojoJ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u24a5dc49" id="u24a5dc49">。由于现代语言模型的词表通常包含数万个 token，例如 GPT-2 的词表大小为 50,257，因此，对输出嵌入对应的 GEMM 进行并行化是有益的</span></strong></p><ul list="u13ac8e07"><li fid="uc01bcbbc" data-lake-id="u56432546" id="u56432546"><span data-lake-id="ub2324918" id="ub2324918">在 Transformer 语言模型中，输出嵌入层与输入嵌入层共享权重，因此需要同时修改二者。沿词表维度，即列维度，对输入嵌入权重矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22E_%7BH%20%5C%5Ctimes%20v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6adddf54d32b3d08d3921fc239bcb642.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y4Ujk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf6594031" id="uf6594031">进行并行划分，得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22E%20%3D%20%5BE_1%2C%20E_2%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F623fefdf5f9307b3d10336c190348312.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ENXCt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u44fdf1e9" id="u44fdf1e9">。由于每个分区此时仅包含嵌入表的一部分，因此需要在输入嵌入操作之后执行一次 all-reduce</span></li><li fid="uc01bcbbc" data-lake-id="ud5fffc0e" id="ud5fffc0e"><span data-lake-id="u4ce44b43" id="u4ce44b43">对于输出嵌入，一种方法是通过并行 GEMM </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5BY_1%2C%20Y_2%5D%20%3D%20%5BXE_1%2C%20XE_2%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F346fefb9756055f2f3da3dfd3166736a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xF1Qm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u475b9028" id="u475b9028">获得 logits，随后执行一次 all-gather，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Ball-gather%7D(%5BY_1%2C%20Y_2%5D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed10b925dc3fac96cd61e92c96d56ca6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qfPMm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7a356af4" id="u7a356af4">，再将结果传递给交叉熵损失函数。然而，在这种情况下，all-gather 需要传输</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%20%5C%5Ctimes%20s%20%5C%5Ctimes%20v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcb43fdc89d2b1e9b0eae8cdf8202b2cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a0ULT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf7ed03d7" id="uf7ed03d7"> 个元素，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29c2e5f4926e5b0e9a95305650f6e54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xsYjz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d780c91" id="u7d780c91"> 为批大小，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NgTSN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5ef1abbe" id="u5ef1abbe">为序列长度。由于词表规模较大，这会产生巨大的通信量</span></li><li fid="uc01bcbbc" data-lake-id="ub3a1e0b1" id="ub3a1e0b1"><span data-lake-id="u93d45402" id="u93d45402">为降低通信量，将并行 GEMM 的输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5BY_1%2C%20Y_2%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6a43220d93408d9055be22fe824b262a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yoy8t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1812956e" id="u1812956e">与交叉熵损失计算进行融合，使通信数据的维度降至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%20%5C%5Ctimes%20s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbfb798949377243ef9a27e74c4fc9912.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tEHoa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufe80d8be" id="ufe80d8be">。通过传输标量损失而非 logits，可以大幅减少通信量，从而提高模型并行方法的效率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud93dfcbe" id="ud93dfcbe"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue31b7560" id="ue31b7560">所采用的大部分模型并行技术，旨在减少通信，并使 GPU 保持计算受限状态。对于 Dropout、层归一化和残差连接等操作，选择在各张 GPU 上重复执行计算，而不是由某张 GPU 完成部分计算后，再将结果广播至其他 GPU</span></strong></p><ul list="u44f96d9a"><li fid="u60a1b04d" data-lake-id="u0b3de4d6" id="u0b3de4d6"><span data-lake-id="ue7db2bc9" id="ue7db2bc9">在每张 GPU 上保留层归一化参数的副本，并对模型并行区域的输出张量执行 Dropout 和残差连接操作，然后将结果作为输入传递至下一个模型并行区域。在模型优化过程中，每个模型并行工作进程负责优化各自的参数集合。由于所有数值要么仅保存在某张 GPU 本地，要么在各张 GPU 上均有副本，因此，在这一方案中无需对更新后的参数值进行通信</span></li></ul>